I then provided the required password to the service.

Netcat concepts I learned

A basic listener can be started using options such as:

nc -lvn

"-l" → listen mode
"-v" → verbose output
"-n" → do not perform DNS resolution
I learned that the listener acts as the server, while the machine connecting to it acts as the client.

What I learned

Basic use of Netcat ("nc")
Client and server concepts
Listening on a port
Connecting to a service on a specific port
Basic network communication using Netcat
